messages.content:
Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: contrib/addtiffo/tif_overview.c
Line: 892
Function: TIFFBuildOverviews
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: papoRawBIs is allocated with _TIFFmalloc at line 864 and not checked for NULL. If allocation fails, writing papoRawBIs[i] = TIFFCreateOvrCache(...) dereferences a NULL base pointer.

Source context:
```c
